# Sounio Loom Multiplexer

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-LOOM-MULTIPLEXER`

Status: executable for Loom-0 on one Unix host. This is a bounded systems
witness, not a novelty, priority, distributed-availability, or host-loss claim.

